摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Manage OpenCode Zen free-tier and Go-tier models in DeepSeek Harness: live listings from opencode.ai, drift per route, four agent tools plus an OpenCode Models settings section.","id":"gh:1344447926","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-opencode-models","slug":"wyouwd1/dsh-opencode-models","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","opencode","zen"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Manage OpenCode Zen free-tier and Go-tier models in DeepSeek Harness: live listings from opencode.ai"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", drift per route, four agent tools plus an OpenCode Models settings section."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-opencode-models"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Manage OpenCode Zen free-tier and Go-tier models in DeepSeek Harness: fetch the live model listings "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"from opencode.ai on demand, compare them with what your routes actually serve, and add or remove ent"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ries — through four agent tools and an \"OpenCode Models\" settings page. The free tier is an explicit"},{"id":"p4s4","text":" official allowlist from the OpenCode Zen docs pricing table (big-pickle, ox-alpha-free, mimo-v2.5-f"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"ree, hy3-free, nemotron-3-ultra-free, nemotron-3.5-lightning-free, muse-spark-1.2-contributor-free):"},{"id":"p4s6","text":" paid ids the free endpoint also advertises never count, drift or get offered, and suffix-only ids o"},{"id":"p4s7","text":"utside that table are not adoptable either."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness serves OpenCode Zen through two `llm-pi-ai` provider routes configured in `~/.dsh/s"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ss serves OpenCode Zen through two `llm-pi-ai` provider routes configured in `~/.dsh/settings.yaml`:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Route | Tier | Endpoint | Model ids |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| `opencode` | Free (`PI_AI_API_KEY`) | `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1` | usually `-free`-suffixed |\n| "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"`opencode-go` | Go subscription | `https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1` | unsuffixed |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The listing endpoints disclose **ids only** — no context windows, output caps, modalities, or reason"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ing levels — and the lists change over time (limited-time models get delisted). This plugin keeps th"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"e two layers honest against each other. The same model often has different ids per tier (`x-preview-"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"f-free` vs `x-preview-f`); it never mixes them."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Agent tools"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Tool | What it does |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `oc_model_status` | Fetches both listings live and reports per tier: configured count, live count,"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" online-but-not-configured ids, delisted-but-still-configured ids. Read-only. |\n| `oc_model_add` | A"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"dds entries to one route. Pass `ids` copied verbatim from a status report or full `models` entries. "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"Ids whose capacities the listing hides require `assumeDefaults: true` (contextWindow 128000, maxToke"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ns 32000, input text) — every assumption is reported so you can correct it later. An id present only"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" in the *other* tier's listing is refused with the two-tier id rule explained. |\n| `oc_model_remove`"},{"id":"p13s7","text":" | Removes configured ids from one route; reports not-found ids and skips the write when nothing mat"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"ched. |\n| `oc_model_sync` | Previews drift for both tiers by default. With `apply: true` it adds eve"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"ry online-not-configured id (assumed capacities flagged); with `pruneStale: true` it also removes de"},{"id":"p13s10","text":"-configured id (assumed capacities flagged); with `pruneStale: true` it also removes delisted ids. |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Model-list edits take effect on the next request — no restart. This plugin never adds or removes who"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"le routes; declaring a new route (apiKeyEnv/baseURL) stays on the Models page and still needs a rest"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"outes; declaring a new route (apiKeyEnv/baseURL) stays on the Models page and still needs a restart."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### \"OpenCode Models\" settings section"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"A section pinned to the TOP of the web settings sidebar shows exactly two cards in order — OpenCode "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"Zen free tier, then Go tier — nothing else. Every configured row has a checkbox and a bulk **delete-"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"selected** bar trims any mix of models across the two lists in one confirmation, removing them from "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"the conversation model list on the next request: configured entries with a \"delisted\" flag on stale "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ones, checkboxes over online-not-configured ids, per-row remove, and a two-click sync (preview → con"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"firm). It reads and writes exclusively through the existing configuration-page contracts — `settings"},{"id":"p16s7","text":".describe` / `settings.update` with `expectedRevision`, and `llm.discoverModels` for the live listin"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"gs — and refreshes only while open when pushed invalidations arrive."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Writes are guarded by the settings revision: if the Models page or another session writes first, thi"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"s plugin re-reads once instead of overwriting it, and schema-invalid candidates are refused before a"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" once instead of overwriting it, and schema-invalid candidates are refused before anything persists."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"From a checkout:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"From GitHub (sources install without any build step — the shipped `lib/` artifacts are plain ESM):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Requirements: DeepSeek Harness ≥ 0.1.1-rc.1 (the `llm-pi-ai` adapter family, settings seam, and web "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"epSeek Harness ≥ 0.1.1-rc.1 (the `llm-pi-ai` adapter family, settings seam, and web app), Node ≥ 22."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"No config keys. The two tier definitions (route keys, base URLs) follow the official OpenCode Zen en"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"dpoint layout and the shared credential comes from each route's existing `apiKeyEnv` (`PI_AI_API_KEY"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"`). Missing credentials surface the endpoint's 401 message verbatim in tool output and in the panel."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Assumed capacities"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The zen listing discloses nothing but ids, so any entry adopted by id needs capacities from somewher"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"e. This plugin's policy:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Explicit `models` entries win — pass real figures when you know them.\n- Otherwise `assumeDefaults:"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" true` (tools) or accepting the panel's checkbox flow fills `contextWindow: 128000, maxTokens: 32000"},{"id":"p28s3","text":", input: [\"text\"]`.\n- Every assumed value is reported back by name; correct them via `oc_model_remov"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"e` + a full re-add whenever you learn better numbers."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Assuming wrong capacities degrades context filing and output caps; it never blocks requests."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The host face (`lib/index.js`) imports no `@deepseek-ai/*` package: tools register as plain definiti"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ons and all services resolve through the cordis context at call time. The browser face (`lib/client."},{"id":"p32s3","text":"js`) ships as the closure-factory artifact the module loader expects and requires only platform-seed"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ed modules (`react`, `dsh-client-ui-primitives`)."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Verification"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Reproduce the install smoke test against an isolated DSH home (no effect on your real `~/.dsh`):"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Muse 接入方案"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"OpenCode Go 的 `muse-spark-1.2-contributor`（地区受限模型）接入指南（独立路由 + 代理 + 思考档位），见 `MUSE.md`。"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
